  "description": "The removal of a registry key within the Windows operating system. *Data Collection Measures:* - Windows Event Logs - Event ID 4658 - Registry Key Handle Closed: Captures when a handle to a registry key is closed, which may indicate deletion. - Event ID 4660 - Object Deleted: Logs when a registry key is deleted. - Sysmon (System Monitor) for Windows - Sysmon Event ID 12 - Registry Key Deleted: Logs when a registry key is removed. - Sysmon Event ID 13 - Registry Value Deleted: Captures removal of specific registry values. - Endpoint Detection and Response (EDR) Solutions - Monitor registry deletions for suspicious behavior.",
